      "writtenOn": "2025-02-11T05:39:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is mainly because:\n\n1. We don\u0027t need to track the staging memory size on D3D11 and OpenGL, so we can just add the logic to the backend it is actually needed.\n2. `mStagingMemorySizeToRelease` needs to be set to 0 after pending command context is submitted, while `SubmitPendingCommands()` is a pure virtual function, so I have to put that reset in the `SubmitPendingCommands()` in each backend.",
      "parentUuid": "087ecabe_f5c6c568",
      "revId": "8229d07ed787a419a5e42b0a8c48240c5e32776c",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
